30354      title 'Spatial Correlation Analysis with PROC VARIOGRAM';
30355      ods graphics on;
30356      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick plots=pairs(thr=30);
30357      compute novariogram nhc=20;
30358      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30359      var Thick;
30360      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1867.

30361      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30362      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 cl robust;
30363      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30364      var Thick;
30365      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1868-1869.

30366      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv plots(only)=moran;
30367      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 autocorr(assum=random);
30368      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30369      var Thick;
30370      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
